    "jcr:primaryType": "nt:unstructured",
    "jcr:lastModifiedBy": "jeannie.chan@stryker.com",
    "text": "<p>Advanced Hardware Designed to Enhance Consumer Experience, While New Online Application Calculates Measurements from X-Ray Upload, Creating a Patient-Specific Plan for Surgeons - Stryker's Foot and Ankle business unit announced the upcoming launch of its new Hoffmann LRF Hexapod hardware and online application, featuring an advanced measurement tool that uses a mathematical algorithm to calculate solutions to correct the deformity. Hoffmann LRF Hexapod is being demonstrated during the American Orthopaedic Foot &amp; Ankle Society (AOFAS) annual meeting from July 12-14 in Seattle.</p>\n<p><b><a href=\"http://www.prnewswire.com/news-releases/stryker-unveils-hoffmann-lrf-hexapod-with-pre-and-post-operative-planning-tool-for-deformity-correction--limb-reconstruction-procedures-300481629.html\">Please click here for the full article.</a></b></p>\n",
